# Cursor AI Rules

Refer to `AGENTS.md` at repository root as the canonical source of truth for all coding standards, architecture, commands, and project conventions.

## Key Rules
- Angular 22 standalone architecture (`bootstrapApplication`).
- Native control flow (`@if`, `@for`, `@switch`) and Angular signals (`input()`, `output()`, `model()`, `computed()`).
- `@ngrx/signals` for feature state stores.
- Strict WCAG AA accessibility compliance.
- Run `pnpm run lint` and `pnpm test` before finalizing tasks.
